{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019HwQ2xaYyirgvmkkLcJLiM","type":"tool_result","content":"# CoRL Acceptance Rates\n\nBased on the Paper Copilot statistics page, here are the acceptance rates across available years:\n\n- **CoRL 2025**: 221 accepted out of 263 submissions = **84.03%**\n- **CoRL 2024**: 264 accepted out of 671 submissions = **39.34%**\n- **CoRL 2023**: 199 accepted out of 498 submissions = **39.96%**\n- **CoRL 2022**: 197 accepted out of 504 submissions = **39.09%**\n- **CoRL 2021**: 153 accepted out of 408 submissions = **37.50%**\n\n## Key Observation\n\nThe 2025 acceptance rate is notably anomalous at over 84%. According to the data, \"The total number of submissions is calculated as: `#Total = #Accept + #Reject + #Withdraw + #Desk Reject`\" However, 2025 shows only accepted and poster/oral breakdowns with no reject data listed, suggesting the 2025 statistics may be incomplete.\n\n**Typical acceptance rate (2021-2024)**: Approximately **39%**, with a range between 37.5% and 40%."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"92117570-3c02-415f-b521-ab56085c264e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:49:42.225Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":143480,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CoRL Acceptance Rates\n\nBased on the Paper Copilot statistics page, here are the acceptance rates across available years:\n\n- **CoRL 2025**: 221 accepted out of 263 submissions = **84.03%**\n- **CoRL 2024**: 264 accepted out of 671 submissions = **39.34%**\n- **CoRL 2023**: 199 accepted out of 498 submissions = **39.96%**\n- **CoRL 2022**: 197 accepted out of 504 submissions = **39.09%**\n- **CoRL 2021**: 153 accepted out of 408 submissions = **37.50%**\n\n## Key Observation\n\nThe 2025 acceptance rate is notably anomalous at over 84%. According to the data, \"The total number of submissions is calculated as: `#Total = #Accept + #Reject + #Withdraw + #Desk Reject`\" However, 2025 shows only accepted and poster/oral breakdowns with no reject data listed, suggesting the 2025 statistics may be incomplete.\n\n**Typical acceptance rate (2021-2024)**: Approximately **39%**, with a range between 37.5% and 40%.","durationMs":4342,"url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/"}}
