{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzhxKrCM1ZHp3pQti7X3N3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- lg_output_head_analysis: D021 Exp-2: Output Head Analysis. Compare trained vs untrained VLA weight differences across layers. If training does \\\\\\\"shallow adaptation\\\\\\\", output head weight diff >> middle layer weight diff. Explains \\\\\\\"representations unchanged but behavior improved\\\\\\\".（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- lg_instruction_ablation: D021 Exp-1: Instruction Ablation. Extract LIBERO-Goal features with empty instruction (trained + untrained VLA), then run RSA. If instruction pathway is the source of action-relevant structure, RSA should collapse from ρ≈0.49 to <0.15. PASS: ρ<0.15; PARTIAL: 0.15<ρ<0.30; FAIL: ρ≥0.30.（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **p0_bootstrap_ci_training_effect** (success): P0: Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean aggregation). Trained RSA=0.5014 vs untrained RSA=0.4847, Δ=+0.017. Task-level resampling bootstrap 95% CI. If CI excludes 0 → Claim 3 needs minor adjustment (\\\\\\\"minimal but detectable\\\\\\\"). If CI includes 0 → Claim 3 \\\\\\\"invariance\\\\\\\" holds.\\\\n- **p0_image_mean_rsa_verify** (success): P0 CRITICAL: Verify Claim 2 (LLM degrades action alignment 0.615→0.488) is not an aggregation artifact. SigLIP uses mean pooling, VLA used last_preaction. Re-run RSA with image_mean feature key for trained with-inst and untrained with-inst. If image_mean RSA ≈ 0.61 → Claim 2 is artifact. If ≈ 0.49 → Claim 2 holds.\\\\n- **plan_003_perlayer_degradation** (success): D028 plan_003: Per-layer RSA degradation curve. Track RSA from SigLIP+projector output (L0=0.615) through LLM layers 1-32 (~0.48). If monotonic decrease → LLM progressively degrades action alignment. If non-monotonic → some layers partially recover. Supports Claim 2 (LLM degrades action-relevant structure).\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 23 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 36\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2097, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw2xX9oxuy5jnTe4rtkkeg","session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"d0692e45-10e8-4ec2-931b-34f9aef50ef4","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:50:56.870Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QZSXyZKMeJNemF2FQXQJPp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BiKsjWoQT2Wo9nGB8qVZ5c","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"vla-ssd","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2390,"cache_read_input_tokens":16631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2390,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":63,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw2xX9oxuy5jnTe4rtkkeg","session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"1c09557b-872b-42f8-bcf1-a26d421af0a6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BiKsjWoQT2Wo9nGB8qVZ5c","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# VLA-SSD Project Memory\\\\n\\\\n## SMOKING GUN 确认：SigLIP+Projector RSA = 0.6153（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**d027_siglip_only_rsa 结果**: SigLIP+projector 直接输出（不过 LLM）的 RSA = 0.6153 [95% CI: 0.5257, 0.6954]。\\\\n\\\\n**关键发现：LLM 降低 action alignment（不是 passthrough）**：\\\\n- SigLIP+projector: **0.6153**\\\\n- Full VLA（任何条件）: ~0.48-0.49\\\\n- DINO: 0.388\\\\n\\\\nLLM 不仅没增强 action-relevant structure，反而将 RSA 从 0.615 降到 ~0.488（约 20% 下降）。这比 \\\\\\\"passthrough\\\\\\\" 更强——是 \\\\\\\"degradation\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n**机制解释**: SigLIP image-text 预训练产生的 visual features 天然具有强 action-relevant 结构。Projector 保持这一结构（cos_sim=1.0 frozen）。LLM 的高维 token mixing 稀释了这种结构（trained 和 untrained LLM 稀释程度一致）。\\\\n\\\\n## Per-Layer Degradation Curve 发现（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**plan_003_perlayer_degradation 结果**：降解非单调，集中在 embedding interface。\\\\n\\\\n**关键机制洞察**：\\\\n- Proj→L1 是最大 single-step drop（0.13–0.25，~20–40%），token embedding 是 degradation bottleneck\\\\n- L0（embedding layer）是异常值：trained 模型 RSA≈0，结构从 L1 才开始恢复\\\\n- 中间层有 partial recovery（non-monotonic），LLM 不是 \\\\\\\"progressive degrader\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **no-inst trained 独特模式**：唯一呈 L1→L30 持续上升的条件（peak at L30），training 在无 instruction 时让 LLM 逐层积累 action 信号。其余 3 个条件均 non-monotonic\\\\n- 总降解幅度 ~0.13：best LLM layer 仍比 projector 低 ~0.127\\\\n\\\\n**对 Claim 2 措辞影响**：应从 \\\\\\\"LLM degrades action alignment\\\\\\\" 精炼为 \\\\\\\"LLM's token embedding interface introduces primary degradation; subsequent layers partially but incompletely recover\\\\\\\"。这个 nuance 对 discussion section 很重要——说明 LLM 不是纯粹有害，而是 \\\\\\\"lossy interface + partial recovery\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n## 完整 2×2 Matrix + SigLIP-only（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n| 条件 | RSA | 备注 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|\\\\n| **SigLIP+Projector (no LLM)** | **0.6153** | smoking gun |\\\\n| Trained with-inst | 0.4876 | L9 peak |\\\\n| Trained no-inst | 0.489 | L30 peak |\\\\n| Untrained with-inst | 0.4846 | L12 peak |\\\\n| Untrained no-inst | 0.4802 | — |\\\\n| DINO | 0.388 | — |\\\\n\\\\n**结论**: 所有 4 个 full VLA 条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band。SigLIP-only 显著高于 full VLA。Training 和 instruction 均无 meaningful effect。\\\\n\\\\n## Instruction Ablation FAIL — Option B 被否证（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**d021_instruction_ablation 结果**: no-inst untrained RSA = 0.4802 ≈ with-inst 0.4846（Δ=0.0044 << 0.10 阈值）。去掉 instruction text 不影响 action-relevant 表征结构。Option B 被明确否证。\\\\n\\\\n## Output Head Analysis 发现（2026-05-15，d021_output_head_analysis = negative）\\\\n\\\\n**Vision backbone + Projector 在 trained 和 untrained 之间完全一致**（rel_change=0, cos_sim=1.0）。这是 trained ≈ untrained 表征结构相似的因果机制。\\\\n\\\\n**Shallow adaptation FAIL**: LLM 权重变化均匀分布 32 层（1.22-1.37），output head 并不特殊（1.12x ratio vs 3x 阈值）。\\\\n\\\\n**Caveat**: trained vs untrained 比较的是 pretrained Llama + fine-tune vs random init，不是 fine-tuned vs pre-fine-tuning。\\\\n\\\\n## RSA Temporal Phase 差异（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n| Phase | Trained | Untrained | DINO |\\\\n|-------|---------|-----------|------|\\\\n| early | 0.32 | **0.41** | **0.49** |\\\\n| mid | 0.52 | **0.52** | 0.41 |\\\\n| late | **0.48** | 0.46 | 0.26 |\\\\n\\\\n## 文献关键发现\\\\n\\\\n14 篇论文确认 vision encoder dominance 是已知现象（behavioral level）。我们在 representation level 发现同一模式，是独特贡献。Grant 2026: LIBERO-Goal 中 language 贡献关键（behavioral level），OFT checkpoint。\\\\n\\\\n## Novelty Gap\\\\n\\\\n| 工作 | 做了什么 | 没做什么 |\\\\n|------|---------|---------|\\\\n| Grant et al. 2026 | Behavioral intervention, \\\\\\\"encoded but not used\\\\\\\" | 无 trained vs untrained 对比 |\\\\n| Swann/Buurmeijer | SAE interpretability on OpenVLA+LIBERO | 无 language features 分析 |\\\\n| LIBERO-CF | Counterfactual behavioral benchmark | 无 representation analysis |\\\\n\\\\n## 方向 Pivot 历史\\\\n\\\\nMVP-1 Temporal Distance → G2 FAIL → MVP-2 Action Prediction → G2 FAIL → Action-Delta → G3 FAIL → D015 Pivot LIBERO-Goal → D018 Goal Classification → G3 FAIL → D019 RSA → G2 FAIL → D021 Instruction Ablation (FAIL) + Output Head (negative) → D027 Option A2 锁定 → **SigLIP-only SMOKING GUN PASS → MVP Gate 通过**\\\\n\\\\n## 技术约束\\\\n\\\\n- Untrained model: from_config() 重新初始化 LLM（6.74B random），保留 SigLIP（0.80B）\\\\n- D017: 统一用 LIBERO-10 fine-tuned checkpoint（LIBERO-Goal 是 OOD 测试）\\\\n- Token 聚合：Primary = last pre-action token\\\\n- 存储：根分区 ~30GB，大文件在 /root/autodl-tmp/vla-ssd/\\\\n- **分析 Worker 不得覆盖 spec 字段**\\\\n- **服务器无外网**：AutoProcessor/HF 操作必须 `local_files_only=True`\\\\n- **Instruction ablation bug**: `if args.task_instruction:` 对空字符串返回 False，已修复\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3945, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw2xX9oxuy5jnTe4rtkkeg","session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"342328ce-fc02-4a76-af89-9ae6db887cfe","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:50:59.773Z"}
