{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014FJnzNejL1RfBdRRygdGzd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# vla-ssd — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 22:29 UTC | 更新原因: D028: complete_mvp 完成，进入 research 阶段。paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 已写，Dream 已提交\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n\\\\n**\\\\\\\"Vision Encoder Dominance: The Architectural Source of Action-Relevant Representations in VLAs\\\\\\\"**（D028 确定）\\\\n\\\\n三个 Core Claims（详见 paper_framing.md）：\\\\n1. Action-relevant 表征源自 frozen SigLIP vision encoder（RSA 0.615 >> VLA 0.488 >> DINO 0.388）\\\\n2. LLM processing 降低 action alignment（degrader, 非 passthrough）\\\\n3. Training 和 instruction 均不改变表征结构（2×2 matrix 收敛）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n\\\\n- **阶段**: Research — post-MVP kickoff 完成，Dream 模拟中\\\\n- **MVP 结果**: 原假设（training 注入知识）系统性否定 → pivot 到 Vision Encoder Dominance\\\\n- **P0 实验全部完成**: 7 probing methods × 2 benchmarks + SigLIP-only RSA smoking gun + instruction ablation + 2×2 matrix + output head analysis\\\\n- **P1 待做**: per-layer RSA degradation curve（CPU）、random instruction control（2h GPU）\\\\n- **Dream**: `dream_20260515T222933` pending，等回调后决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 完成 → 分析审稿报告 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P1 实验（per-layer degradation curve + random instruction control）\\\\n- [ ] 启动 Paper Agent（Full Draft 模式，CoRL 2026）\\\\n- [ ] P1 实验结果补入论文\\\\n\\\\n## 时间线（CoRL 2026）\\\\n\\\\n| 里程碑 | 日期 | 剩余天数 |\\\\n|--------|------|---------|\\\\n| Abstract DDL | May 26 | 11 |\\\\n| Paper DDL | May 29 | 14 |\\\\n| Dream 完成 | May 15-16 | 0-1 |\\\\n| P1 实验完成 | May 16-17 | 1-2 |\\\\n| Paper Agent Full Draft | May 17-20 | 2-5 |\\\\n| Review + Iteration | May 20-28 | 5-13 |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n\\\\nwestd-19183: 2×RTX PRO 6000 | 当前 0/2 占用（等 Dream 结果后派 P1 实验）\\\\nP0 已用 ~13h GPU | P1 需 ~2h GPU + CPU | P2 需 ~4h（时间允许）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-15 | D029: Claim 2 聚合伪影排除。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501 仍远低于 | d027_siglip_only_rsa, plan_003_perlayer_degradation, d027_trained_no_inst_rsa |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-15 | D028: SigLIP-only RSA smoking gun PASS (0.615 >> 0 | d027_siglip_only_rsa, d027_trained_no_inst_rsa, d021_instruction_ablation |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-15 | D027: Instruction Ablation FAIL — Option B 死亡，回退 O | d021_instruction_ablation, d021_output_head_analysis, lg_rsa_analysis |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-15 | D025: Output head analysis FAIL — shallow adaptati | d021_output_head_analysis, d021_instruction_ablation |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-15 | D024: Instruction ablation gate 从绝对阈值改为 DINO-ancho | d021_instruction_ablation |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-15 | D023: Reviewer 评估 D021 framing — 接受 claim 精度建议，记录  | d021_instruction_ablation, d021_output_head_analysis |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-15 | D023: Reviewer 共识——B framing 可行但 claim 需收窄为 \\\\\\\"instr | d021_instruction_ablation, d021_output_head_analysis |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-15 | D021: RSA G2 FAIL (Δρ=0.003 << 0.08)。6 轮 probing 一 | lg_rsa_analysis, mvp_probe_trained, mvp2_action_trained, lg_gc_untrained, lg_pca1024_linear_pertimestep |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-15 | D021: Framing pivot 到 Option B \\\\\\\"Architecture Trump | lg_rsa_analysis, mvp_probe_trained, mvp2_action_trained, mvp2_action_dino, lg_gc_untrained |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-15 | D020: RSA success gates 定义 + 要求在 LIBERO-Goal 上优先运行 | lg_rsa_analysis, lg_gc_untrained, lg_pca1024_linear_pertimestep |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3056, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw2xX9oxuy5jnTe4rtkkeg","session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"7f28659b-e233-4ec0-ac57-d6892c548685","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:51:00.763Z"}
