{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HZpBbfTqrZJD1kCvMnTosD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# RSA image_mean Validation — Claim 2\n2\t\n3\t## 核心数值\n4\t\n5\t| Condition | last_preaction | image_mean | delta |\n6\t|-----------|---------------|------------|-------|\n7\t| **Trained** (peak, layer 23) | 0.4876 | **0.5014** | +0.0138 |\n8\t| **Untrained** (peak, layer 23) | 0.4846 | **0.4847** | +0.0001 |\n9\t| **SigLIP projector** | — | **0.6153** | — |\n10\t\n11\t## 关键发现\n12\t\n13\t### image_mean RSA = 0.5014（trained peak），远低于 SigLIP 0.6153\n14\t\n15\t- **image_mean trained peak RSA: 0.5014** (layer 23)\n16\t- **image_mean untrained peak RSA: 0.4847** (layer 23)\n17\t- **SigLIP projector RSA: 0.6153**\n18\t- **Gap: 0.6153 → 0.5014 = -0.1139**\n19\t\n20\t### Claim 2 判定: **HOLDS — LLM 确实降解 action alignment**\n21\t\n22\timage_mean RSA (0.5014) ≈ 0.50，远低于 SigLIP (0.6153)，与 last_preaction (0.4876) 在同一量级。\n23\t这排除了\"聚合伪影\"假说——即使使用与 SigLIP 相同的 mean pooling 策略，VLA 的 action alignment 仍然显著低于 SigLIP projector。\n24\t\n25\t### 补充观察\n26\t\n27\t- image_mean 比 last_preaction 略高 (+0.0138 for trained)，说明 mean pooling 确实比单 token 聚合稍好\n28\t- 但这个提升很小，不改变 0.61→0.50 的主结论\n29\t- trained vs untrained delta (0.5014 - 0.4847 = +0.0167) 也与 last_preaction 的 delta (0.4876 - 0.4846 = +0.003) 方向一致，且更大\n30\t\n31\t## 判断标准对照\n32\t\n33\t- image_mean RSA ≈ 0.61 → 聚合伪影 → **未发生**\n34\t- image_mean RSA ≈ 0.49 → LLM 确实降解 → **✓ 发生 (0.5014)**\n35\t- 中间值 → 需要讨论 → **不适用**\n36\t\n37\t## 可复现命令\n38\t\n39\t```bash\n40\t# 服务器: westd-19183\n41\tsource /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base\n42\tcd /root/vla-ssd\n43\tpython3 rsa_image_mean.py\n44\t# 结果: /root/autodl-tmp/vla-ssd/results/rsa/rsa_image_mean.json\n45\t```\n46\t\n47\t## 脚本路径\n48\t\n49\t- `/root/vla-ssd/rsa_image_mean.py` (已有，无需修改)\n50\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lw2xX9oxuy5jnTe4rtkkeg","session_id":"53be8891-6c2e-4099-b6c6-0858d8cae474","uuid":"72304b01-c024-4c5d-8c9f-0952ba8115a4","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:51:31.426Z"}
